// SupplementalRefactoringClasses.pkg
//
// Use statements for class packages that are shipped as part of the DFRefactor
// tool but kept separate from the core engine. These classes provide additional
// refactoring capabilities beyond those built into cRefactorFuncLib.
//
// NOTE: This file is NOT intended for user additions. For your own private class
// packages, add Use statements to UserDefinedUseStatement.pkg instead.
//
Use RefactorConstants.h.pkg
Use cRemoveUnusedLocals.pkg
Use cUnicodePointerToString.pkg
Use cUnicodeStringToPointer.pkg
Use cParsePathPairToFilePath.pkg
Use cLegacyClassSwap.pkg
Use cWin64PointerTruncation.pkg
Use cWin64StructPadding.pkg
Use cUnusedSourceFiles.pkg
Use cShadowedPackageFiles.pkg
Use cUnusedUseStatements.pkg
Use cDDOReStyler.pkg
Use cDbGridTocDbCJGrid.pkg
Use cDbListTocDbCJGridPromptList.pkg
Use cGridToCJGrid.pkg
Use cListToCJGrid.pkg
Use cGridSubclassPorter.pkg      // ConvertGridSubclassToCodeJock - a grid subclass ported in place, then its objects

// .err analysis track (Phase 1): the compiler-error triage brain (see project_err_analysis).
Use cModAnalyzer.pkg

// Deep Scan: source-driven obsolete-symbol scanner - finds the retired language surface
// the compiler never warns about, straight from the source (no compile needed).
Use cDeepScanner.pkg
